<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Florida bonds for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Florida bonds for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance Florida Department of General Services's $9.53 million bond deal, set for competitive bid today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
